sequenceDiagram
    %% the origin poller merges what changed on GitHub
    participant poller as Origin poller
    participant gh as GitHub
    participant merge as merge_file
    participant engine as Engine
    loop every tick
        poller->>gh: list the changes since the last commit
        gh-->>poller: changed files
        opt something changed
            poller->>gh: fetch the files
            gh-->>poller: contents
            poller->>merge: base, ours, theirs
            alt merges cleanly
                merge-->>poller: merged text
                poller->>engine: apply
            else conflict
                merge-->>poller: conflict
                Note right of poller: kept for the person to decide
            end
        end
    end
